{"parse": {"title": "JMP-01", "pageid": 6185, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">JMP-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/JMP-02\" title=\"JMP-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">JMP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A7.82.E6.98.9F.E8.80.85.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"观星者们\">观星者们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 观星者们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Stargazers</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>现<span class=\"color-value\"></span>实<span class=\"color-value\"></span>碎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>凑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>成<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>梦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>总<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>带<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>锋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>利<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>边<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1310101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……关于类星体，我们有以下假设……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会场内座无虚席。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>讲台下方的黑暗翻涌着。那些质询的，审视的，或许在镜片后的目光滑出了黑暗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛我们曾在塔顶观测到的，那些几光年外的讯号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>根据光谱红移，施密特博士初步推算它的退行速度可达到光速的六分之一……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第三页……第三页我记得我放在……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_kongbaideheiban2\"><img alt=\"at_kongbaideheiban2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png/600px-Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png/900px-Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png/1200px-Cg-at_kongbaideheiban2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……通常，我们认为恒星黑洞是恒星坍塌后的遗骸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红色的粉笔在黑板上的圆圈周边留下了一圈嶙峋的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>它们相互斗争、吸引、融合，最终成为超大质量黑洞——也是其周围星系内恒星的最后归宿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>啊，第三页在这儿。是库玛尔给我调整的位置吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>“于那时日，混沌中空无一物。存在者与非存在者皆无，无至上之域，无大气，无天穹。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_1：</div><div><i>“无死无生，无昼无夜。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_2：</div><div>类星体之中……正发生着一场近似于超新星爆发的剧烈活动。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_kongbaideheiban3\"><img alt=\"at_kongbaideheiban3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png/600px-Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png/900px-Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png/1200px-Cg-at_kongbaideheiban3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_2：</div><div>它吞噬恒星……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_2：</div><div>其生成的气体云在引力作用下又将重新耦合——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_2：</div><div>诞生出新的恒星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_2：</div><div>它是由恒星的尸骸融成的墓茔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-307020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？_2：</div><div>——却亦是恒星诞生的摇篮。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xingkong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xingkong\"><img alt=\"xingkong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/600px-Cg-xingkong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/900px-Cg-xingkong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/1200px-Cg-xingkong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风，草地，新鲜的空气，这里是个并不隐秘的好去处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今日的夜空格外的晴朗，群星闪烁，清晰可辨。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidating\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-613320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-613320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-613320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>成功的演讲，伽菈波那。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的声音与步伐节奏，无需回头，脑海便能浮现出那抹身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-307012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-307012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-307012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>感谢你难得的夸奖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出手去，仿佛能碰到繁星。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_xuyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_xuyuan\"><img alt=\"at_xuyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-at_xuyuan.png/600px-Cg-at_xuyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-at_xuyuan.png/900px-Cg-at_xuyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-at_xuyuan.png/1200px-Cg-at_xuyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>没想到你离开这么长的时间，回来第一件事就是亲自来看我出糗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>你知道，我并不擅长这些……我现在仍认为自己在第三部分的一处用词不够精准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哦，但你也知道，我无法抗拒这样美妙的观众席——<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身侧草丛窸窣作响——有人并排躺了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>既能与讲台上的瞩目者心照不宣，又能清晰地感受周围的窃窃私语……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>置身事内的绝佳观景位，正如同我们在这个星球上去观测宇宙里的一切！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>唉。比起评判你的个人趣味……库玛尔，我认为之后的观测仍需要做一些细节上的调整——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我有个建议——这会儿放下工作如何？就好好儿地、单纯地看看这些星星……往那边躺躺，这草怎么像松针似的扎人……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xingkong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xingkong\"><img alt=\"xingkong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/600px-Cg-xingkong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/900px-Cg-xingkong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/1200px-Cg-xingkong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……在你离开的这几个月里，研究所的达恩曾来过。看他的态度，似乎已经对我的人类身份起了疑心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>这样下去我们很有可能被踢出这个原本属于我们自己的项目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>关于那个特殊天体的观测资料我已经全部销毁了……至少这样可以暂时确保观测方式只有咱们两人掌握。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长久的沉默。伽菈波那微微侧头望向身侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>看你的表情……我做错了什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>不，以研究项目的角度来说，你做得很好——不过我对此早有预料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音出奇地平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我们不总是这样？偷偷摸摸、躲躲藏藏，做一些——<span style=\"font-size:108%\"><b>完全</b></span>与世无争的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……你知道吗？我真的有些厌烦了，厌烦这些“星际尘土”之间的无聊斗争，明明死了之后都会变为这个偌大宇宙的一部分……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深深叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……算了，这又不是第一次。反正我无论在哪边都不受欢迎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>嘁，说起这个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她显然因为这个话题被勾起了更不好的回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-613311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-613311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-613311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我那对父母——我和你说过的，那对因为我见鬼的薄弱神秘学家血统而抛弃我的父母……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-613311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-613311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-613311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>如今……他们竟然感到对不起我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-613312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>更离谱的是——我那个傻弟弟竟然一无所知……甚至没认出我是他姐姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……你这次回乡见到他们了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>见？不，亲爱的，我是去——反正不是为了听人忏悔去的！我没在乎过那些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我只是去处理些小事……而且很顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎感到了安心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>顺利到……我把我能做到的，都做到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>伽菈波那，如果……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵风吹过草地。纤维细碎的摩擦音清晰地传入耳中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-613310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-613310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-613310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>如果有一天，我们能亲眼看到那个天体，能触碰到它的话……我一定——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-307013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-307013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-307013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>库玛尔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>你在说什……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩倏地支起身子，试图看清身旁的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可对方的面容就像是隐藏在黑色的浓雾之后，令人无法辨认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-613310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-613310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-613310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>把他们*……&amp;%……都*&amp;*——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>库玛尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-307013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-307013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-307013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "JMP-01"}}